      "text": "So he drove out the man, Gen. 3:24 (Moses 4:31). thou hast driven me out this day, Gen. 4:14. chariot wheels, that they drave them heavily, Ex. 14:25. drive out all these nations from before you, Deut. 11:23 (4:38). thou didst drive out the heathen, Ps. 44:2. rod of correction shall drive it far from him, Prov. 22:15. north wind driveth away rain, Prov. 25:23. I have driven him out for his wickedness, Ezek. 31:11. they shall drive thee from men, Dan. 4:25 (4:32). I will gather her that is driven out, Micah 4:6 (Zeph. 3:19).",
